# cpreflight suppressions.
#
# Format: <rule-id>            -> silence that rule everywhere
#         <rule-id>:<glob>     -> silence it for matching paths only
#
# Our Dependabot policy is deliberate: hold MAJOR bumps (they are the breaking
# ones we want to schedule by hand) but let MINOR and patch updates flow, because
# those carry the security fixes. The dependabot-major-only-ignore rule reports
# exactly that shape on purpose, so it is suppressed here rather than weakened.
dependabot-major-only-ignore:.github/dependabot.yml

# Test fixtures legitimately contain credential-shaped strings ("sk_live_...")
# so the rule can prove it fires. They are not real secrets.
hardcoded-credential:tests
